@host = http://localhost:5141
@date = 2026-11-16

### Lines the caller may see (manager by default)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/lines
Accept: application/json

### An operator needs exactly one line id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/lines
X-Demo-Role: operator
X-Demo-LineIds: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### KPI cards
GET {{host}}/api/v1/kpi/summary?date={{date}}

### Plan vs actual per hour
GET {{host}}/api/v1/plan-vs-actual?date={{date}}

### FPY by station
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fpy/stations?date={{date}}

### FPY trend
GET {{host}}/api/v1/fpy/trend?from=2026-11-10&to={{date}}

### Defect Pareto and DPMO
GET {{host}}/api/v1/defects/pareto?from=2026-11-10&to={{date}}

### Thresholds
GET {{host}}/api/v1/config/thresholds

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
